  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Across the 119 countries with a score on all nine capabilities, one shared factor carries 54.5% of the variation, and that factor correlates 0.85 with income. A country's income predicts much of its profile, but not all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Below are the 10 widest gaps between a country's score and the median score of the 10 countries nearest to it in income: five above, five below. Each counts only a score with usable evidence. Each country appears once, each capability at most twice, and a case is left out where a known artefact names that country on that capability. Under each gap, the table shows which rows of the score carry it."
    },
